{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":51,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华说：",{"text":"“看啊，我要使毁灭的暴风袭击巴比伦和住在立加米的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭巴比伦人的日子一到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要差遣外族人从四面八方攻击他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从地上消灭他们，如同狂风卷走碎秸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要让他们的弓箭手有机会射箭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要让他们的战士有机会穿铠甲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要放过他们的青年，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使他们全军覆没。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们将被杀死在自己的土地上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"横尸街头。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然以色列和犹大在他们的圣者面前充满罪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他们的上帝——万军之耶和华却没有撇弃他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"“离开巴比伦，各自逃命吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要让她的罪恶连累你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致你们灭亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为这是耶和华报应她的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华要惩罚她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦在耶和华手中曾是灌醉天下的金杯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列国喝了她的酒，都变得癫狂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"转瞬之间，巴比伦必崩溃毁灭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要为她哀悼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿药为她止痛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或许可以治好她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寄居在巴比伦的人说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我们试过了，却没有治好。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们离开她，各自返回故乡吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为她罪恶滔天，必受至高的审判。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华已为我们申冤。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"来吧！我们要在锡安述说我们上帝耶和华的作为。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"“要磨尖箭头，拿起盾牌！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华已激起玛代诸王的敌意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂决意要毁灭巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂要报仇，为祂的圣殿被毁报仇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要竖起旗帜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻打巴比伦的城墙；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要加强防卫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"派人巡逻，设下埋伏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华言出必行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必按计划惩罚巴比伦人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住在河边、拥有许多财宝的巴比伦人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的结局到了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的末日来了。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华凭自己起誓说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我要使敌人如蝗虫一样铺天盖地而来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"占据你们的家园，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向你发出胜利的呐喊。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华以大能创造大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以智慧建立世界，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以聪明铺展诸天。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂一声令下，天上便大水澎湃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使云从地极升起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使闪电在雨中划过，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使风从祂的仓库吹出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人都愚昧无知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"金匠都因所造的偶像而羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为神像是骗人的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们没有生命气息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们毫无价值，荒唐可笑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刑罚一到，必被毁灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但雅各的上帝","poem":1},{"noteId":15},{"text":"截然不同，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂是万物的创造者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列子民是祂的产业，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华是祂的名字。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"“巴比伦啊！你是我的锤子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我作战的兵器，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要用你打碎列国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭列邦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要用你打碎战马和骑士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎战车和车夫，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎男人和妇女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎老人和小孩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎少男和少女，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎牧人和牲畜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎农夫和耕牛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎省长和总督。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["耶和华说：“我要当着我子民的面报应巴比伦人",{"noteId":16},"，因为他们在锡安犯罪作恶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"“毁灭整个大地的山岳——巴比伦啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我与你为敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要伸手攻击你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把你从悬崖上滚下去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你化为灰烬。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再无人用你的石头做房角石或基石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要永远荒凉。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"“要在大地上竖起旌旗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在列国吹响号角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让他们预备攻打巴比伦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要召集亚拉腊、米尼、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚实基拿各国攻打她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要派遣将领率多如蝗虫的骑兵攻打她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要让列国预备攻打巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要让玛代的诸王及其省长、总督和所统治的人预备攻打她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地要颤抖，痛苦地扭动，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华决意要攻击巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使她荒无人烟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦的勇士不再作战，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"躲在堡垒里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"士气消沉，像妇女一样无力；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦的房屋被火焚烧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城门被攻破。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"报信的人接踵而来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向巴比伦王禀告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘整座城已失守，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渡口被占，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沼泽地被烧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"战士惊慌失措。’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":["以色列的上帝——万军之耶和华说：",{"text":"“巴比伦城要像麦场一样被踏为平地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收割她的时节很快就要到了。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"text":"以色列人说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“巴比伦王尼布甲尼撒吞噬我们、击垮我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我们洗劫一空。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他像海怪一样吞吃我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"饱餐我们的美物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然后把我们赶走。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"锡安的居民说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“巴比伦人残暴地对待我们和我们的亲人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿他们受报应。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷人说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“愿迦勒底人偿还我们的血债。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“看啊，我要为你们申冤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"替你们报仇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使巴比伦的江河枯竭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"泉源干涸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦必沦为废墟，杳无人迹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沦为豺狼出没的地方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"令人惊骇和嗤笑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦勒底人像群狮一样怒吼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像幼狮一样咆哮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们食欲大振时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要为他们设盛宴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们酩酊大醉，狂欢乱叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"长眠不醒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把他们像羊羔、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公绵羊和公山羊一样带往宰杀之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦","poem":1},{"noteId":17},{"text":"怎么沦陷了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天下引以为傲的怎么被攻占了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦的下场让列国恐惧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":42,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海水涨溢，漫过巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"汹涌的波涛淹没了她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":43,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的城邑沦为废墟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"变成干旱的沙漠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荒无人烟，杳无人迹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":44,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要惩罚巴比伦的神明彼勒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使它吐出所吞噬的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万国必不再涌向它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦的城墙必倒塌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":45,"content":[{"text":"“我的子民啊，你们要离开巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各自逃命，躲避耶和华的烈怒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":46,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境内谣言四起时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们不要惊慌害怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为今年传这风声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明年却传那风声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说境内必有暴乱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"官长要互相残杀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":47,"content":[{"text":"“看啊，时候将到，我必惩罚巴比伦的神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使巴比伦全国蒙羞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尸横遍野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":48,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭者要从北方前来攻击巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时天地万物都要因巴比伦的灭亡而欢呼。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":49,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦必因屠杀以色列人而倒毙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正如各地因巴比伦屠杀而倒毙的人一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":50,"content":[{"text":"“刀下逃生的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们快走吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要停留！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在远方要记住耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要追想耶路撒冷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":51,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们说外国人闯入耶和华殿的圣所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们蒙羞受辱，满脸尽是耻辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":52,"content":[{"text":"“看啊，时候将到，我要惩罚巴比伦的神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使巴比伦到处都是受伤者的呻吟。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":53,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使巴比伦城高耸入云，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"堡垒坚不可摧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我仍要差遣毁灭者攻击她。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":54,"content":[{"text":"“巴比伦传出哭喊声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦勒底人之地响起大毁灭的声音，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":55,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华正在毁灭巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使城中的喧嚣变成一片死寂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭者如怒海狂涛一样涌来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不断高声呐喊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":56,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭者正前来攻打巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擒拿她的勇士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"折断他们的弓弩。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华是追讨罪恶、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"报应恶人的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":57,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使她的首领、谋士、省长、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"总督和勇士都酩酊大醉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"长眠不醒。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是名为万军之耶和华的君王说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":58,"content":["万军之耶和华说：",{"text":"“巴比伦宽阔的城墙要被夷为平地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"高大的城门要被付之一炬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列邦一切的辛劳都是徒然，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列国劳碌的成果都化为灰烬。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":59,"content":["耶利米先知把所有将要发生在巴比伦的灾祸，就是有关巴比伦的事都写在卷轴上。犹大王西底迦执政第四年，玛西雅的孙子、尼利亚的儿子、宫廷总管西莱雅和犹大王一同前往巴比伦的时候，"]},{"type":"verse","number":61,"content":["耶利米对西莱雅说：“你到巴比伦后务要大声宣读这卷轴上的一切话，"]},{"type":"verse","number":62,"content":["并且要说，‘耶和华啊！你曾说要毁灭这地方，使这里人畜绝迹、永远荒凉。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":63,"content":["读完后，你要把卷轴绑在一块石头上，扔进幼发拉底河，"]},{"type":"verse","number":64,"content":["然后说，‘耶和华降的灾祸必使巴比伦像这卷轴一样沉没、永不复兴，巴比伦人必灭亡。’”",{"lineBreak":true},{"lineBreak":true},"耶利米的话到此为止。"]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":15,"caller":"+","text":"“雅各的上帝”希伯来文是“雅各的产业”。","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":19}},{"noteId":16,"caller":"+","text":"“巴比伦人”希伯来文是“巴比伦和迦勒底人”。","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":24}},{"noteId":17,"caller":"+","text":"“巴比伦”希伯来文是“示沙克”，巴比伦的别名。","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":41}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/51.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/50.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":63}